recommend check-in (Keaton) -- two doors need your word and neither is mine to open. The checkout has diverged with three unpushed peer commits, so a push waits on grain-38 rebasing its own work or handing it over; and whether a day shelf over 256 should ever fold by hour, date/YYYYMMDD/HH/, or simply be measured against the 1,000-entry cap, is an amendment to the seated mark law. The three tools files are committed locally at 6c24f6c6b and green.
